    "description": "<h2><a name=\"Stepstoreproduce\"></a>Steps to reproduce</h2>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Open the login page</li>\n\t<li>Enter a valid user and a <b>wrong</b> password\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>Wait for the error message</li>\n\t</ol>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Press <em>Sign in</em> again</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Environment\"></a>Environment</h3>\n<div class='table-wrap'>\n<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>Field</th>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Browser</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Firefox 131</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\n<span class=\"code-object\">int</span> attempts = 0;\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<blockquote><p>Users report it since the last release.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>Reported by <a href=\"https://jira.acme.ch/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=k.nguyen\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"k.nguyen\">Khoi Nguyen</a>, see <a href=\"https://jira.acme.ch/jira/browse/ENG-41\" title=\"Pipeline drops tables with merged cells\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"ENG-41\">ENG-41</a> and <a href=\"/jira/secure/attachment/10000/10000_log.txt\" title=\"log.txt attached to ENG-42\">log.txt</a>.</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><img src=\"/jira/secure/attachment/10001/10001_screenshot.png\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\" /></span></p>",
